n&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D"xp1" style=3D"margin:0cm;line-h=
eight:150%">Thank you again for speaking with me earlier this year, and for =
your thoughtful email in April. I appreciated the time you took to understan=
d my experience, and I completely understand the limitations you described r=
egarding the charity=E2=80=99s capacity and areas of work.<span style=3D"font-family=
:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D"xp2" sty=
