m;line-height:150%">I am writing now with a significant update.<span style=3D"=
font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p clas=
s=3D"xp2" style=3D"margin:0cm;line-height:150%">&nbsp;<span style=3D"font-family:&=
quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D"xp1" style=
=3D"margin:0cm;line-height:150%">Since our conversation, I have formally filed=
 a <b>Judicial Review</b>&nbsp;in the High Court, and <b>the claim was seale=
d yesterday under case reference</b> <b>AC-2025-LON-004293</b>. It appears=E2=80=
=94consistent with what you mentioned in your evidence to the <b>Autism Act 20=
09 Committee</b>=E2=80=94that this may be the first JR in the UK to directly chall=
enge:<span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p>=
</span></p><ul type=3D"disc"><li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:a=
uto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;line-height:150%;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3">non=
-compliance with the Autism Act 2009 statutory guidance,<span style=3D"font-fa=
