oNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;line-heig=
ht:150%;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3">failures under the Equality Act 2010 and th=
e Public Sector Equality Duty (PSED), and<span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Time=
s New Roman&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D=
"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;line-height:150%;mso-lis=
t:l2 level1 lfo3">systemic procedural barriers affecting autistic court user=
s.<span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></s=
