 style=3D"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p=
><p class=3D"xp1" style=3D"margin:0cm;line-height:150%">Your remarks to Parliame=
nt about the absence of any legal challenge under the Autism Act have stayed=
 with me, and they were an important part of recognising that the issues I e=
xperienced needed to be addressed at a public-law level.<span style=3D"font-fa=
mily:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D"xp1"=
 style=3D"margin:0cm;line-height:150%">Given where the case now stands, I wond=
ered whether you might be able to assist in one or both of the following way=
s, in line with what you suggested back in April:<span style=3D"font-family:&q=
uot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D"xp4" style=3D=
"margin:0cm;line-height:150%"><b>&nbsp;</b><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Ti=
mes New Roman&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D"xp4" style=3D"margi=
n:0cm;line-height:150%"><b>1. Direction to individuals or organisations</b><=
span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></span=
></p><p class=3D"xp2" style=3D"margin:0cm;line-height:150%">&nbsp;<span style=3D"f=
ont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=
=3D"xp1" style=3D"margin:0cm;line-height:150%">You mentioned that you might be a=
ble to point me toward people better placed to help. At this stage, I would =
be grateful for any referrals to:<span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Times New Ro=
man&quot;,serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><ul type=3D"disc"><li class=3D"MsoNormal"=
